# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To install, first create a new Python environment:\n"
msgstr "Para mag-install, gumawa muna ng bagong Python environment:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Mga kinakailangan {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Gumawa ng minimal na environment na Python lang ang naka-install. Inirerekomenda naming gumamit ng [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "I-activate ang bago mong environment.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On Windows, run `\\path\\to\\virtual\\environment\\Scripts\\activate` instead.\n"
msgstr "Sa Windows, patakbuhin na lang ang `\\path\\to\\virtual\\environment\\Scripts\\activate`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package – from PyPI or source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "May dalawang pangunahing paraan para i-install ang package na ito – mula sa PyPI o sa source. Ang mas gustong paraan ay ang pag-install mula sa PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "I-install mula sa PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The optional `sbd` and `fulqrum` extras, and the `notebook-dependencies` extra that includes them, are supported only on Linux and macOS.\n"
msgstr "Ang opsyonal na `sbd` at `fulqrum` extras, at ang `notebook-dependencies` extra na kinabibilangan ng mga ito, ay sinusuportahan lang sa Linux at macOS.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "I-install mula sa source {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source if you wish to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally.\n"
msgstr "I-install mula sa source kung gusto mong mag-develop sa repository o patakbuhin ang mga notebook nang lokal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-sqd` repository.\n"
msgstr "Ang unang hakbang ay i-clone ang repository na `qiskit-addon-sqd`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Susunod, i-upgrade ang pip at pumasok sa repository.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-sqd` to the virtual environment. If you plan on running the notebooks, install the notebook dependencies in order to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. Install the `dev` dependencies if you plan on developing in the repository.\n"
msgstr "Ang susunod na hakbang ay i-install ang `qiskit-addon-sqd` sa virtual environment. Kung balak mong patakbuhin ang mga notebook, i-install ang mga notebook dependency para mapatakbo ang lahat ng visualization sa mga notebook. I-install ang mga `dev` dependency kung balak mong mag-develop sa repository.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Ayusin ang mga opsyon sa ibaba ayon sa pangangailangan mo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Kung na-install mo ang mga notebook dependency, puwede ka nang magsimula sa pamamagitan ng pagpapatakbo ng mga notebook sa docs.\n"
